8399\">5510C14</a></p><p>Carry out op.\n                                          <a href=\"#/3237460\">1016A36</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237460\">1016A36</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237557\">1072B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237461\">1016A42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on the lifting bridge.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237651\">1016A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237647\">1092G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237642\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p>"],[2047,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237715\">1092E10</a></p>"],[6,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a></p><p>1. Unscrew screw (1a) and remove timing system fixed tenioner (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014002.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit timing system fixed tensioner and fix\nit with its screw to the prescribed torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\